{"id":2364,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>1月7日，校长陈钱深入文瀛10号公寓，调研指导由机械工程学院牵头的博雅书院“一站式”学生社区工作。学生工作部负责人、后勤管理部负责人，机械工程学院等相关人员陪同调研。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nz-dsnlMfMR-bM-8UDMNl8Uml8UzvW4MRN8M4vYLlLYLlL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yPU1ysLkhfnmMkMzUaM47sL8Q2L8LYozUPU4GbM4r7nlWFUzL8U8-4UmVFMR94MzNJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPM4CsgtA8pUHcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31767&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/61B70AF3B5407173FF3C2941C0975DEB/A34CB3B1/48359\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 470px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nR6dfU4fRUmnVL-z98UN-4Lzl8M4NWaMNCiUlrRnlCsM870gihFp2hmCIa0L1hfU1hRoSysUNCanmWRnN7ZM7-DU4UYLRrRU8-DoR7bL4fFnN-DMNl4MzfFUzA7ozTVgtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4LzvDMYbw62H8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31767&e=.jpg\"></p><p></p><p>陈钱一行实地考察了社区自习室，并重点走访了“太行雅室”（党建）、“龙山雅舍”（女性成长）、“汾水雅阁”（心理健康）三大特色工作室。在详细了解各功能区运行情况后，陈钱对社区建设成效给予肯定。他强调，要致力打造优质学习环境，充分发挥党员先锋模范作用，筑牢学生心理健康防线，并鼓励学院持续深挖工科女生特色育人内涵。 </p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2M7rd7nRGsMzVfL-4Q7LNWkM7Wkn7UWZoz7PLmCDM7LZM8-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yDMYh7L1hkL47ioz9ZMzfVMzGbLR-boRvsM4rRU4A7MzTFMmLYL4lsM4QFMR9sU4CJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPM4CsgtA8pUHcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31767&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/667D2B31598850E50902987775CC8D59/63235776/487C6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 463px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2L4TdfnmGaM4vZU-N-8MmQfMz-4LN7WPLRU8Lm9bMRG4Lmv0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyZnkyDLSyPnNM7M7UaoR7inN78nl-aL4W2n7CZnzNinNMFMl-YL4VfL8nFUzQfolnkgtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4LzvDMYbw62H8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31767&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p>陈钱指出，“一站式”学生社区是育人力量下沉的重要平台。他要求相关部门与学院加强协同，持续优化空间功能，强化工作实效，真正将社区建设成为学生喜爱、信赖的成长家园。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2UlLd4LRr7oRQRM-7LsL4vYL8L4nzAWVMmL4o7UZnlWko770gihFp2hmCIa0U1hkMSh2n1h2LRAkLzCaL8nkozN4o7nkLNlsLlCZUlQRLmfFMlCPoRlDnRnFMzL4ollJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPM4CsgtA8pUHcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31767&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BB5FFF08B1603DB9938DB2E71F8AFC20/5F1856D4/5339E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 460px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2L7Md2L4Qkn7rkn-zC8LRCin7lZMNrWkol-4LN7DLzCso7U0gihFp2hmCIa0LYysLYyPMkyDLR7aUz7iL874L4r7M7M7LmV2MNUYnm6kMzVFnmlYLlWfM7MFUmL8Mm9bgtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4LzvDMYbw62H8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31767&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p>机械工程学院将认真落实校领导指示，进一步提升社区育人服务水平。</p><p><strong></strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>一审一校/韩佳明</strong><br><strong>二审二校/王浩然</strong><br><strong>三审三校/王慧慧</strong><br></p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nz-dsnlMfMR-bM-8UDMNl8Uml8UzvW4MRN8M4vYLlLYLlL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yPU1ysLkhfnmMkMzUaM47sL8Q2L8LYozUPU4GbM4r7nlWFUzL8U8-4UmVFMR94MzNJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPM4CsgtA8pUHcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31767&e=.jpg"}